# H/C/O example: system.data must define exactly these three atom types.
units metal
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array
boundary p p p
read_data system.data
mass 1 1.008
mass 2 12.011
mass 3 15.999
neighbor 0.5 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
pair_style mff/torch/kk 4.5 cuda
pair_coeff * * models/core.pt H C O
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms pe fmax
dump forces all custom 1 forces.dump id type x y z fx fy fz
run 0
